{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_e84b170547b94b28be27584dd3fef74b","id":"pg_59363f5e9b775e7eb33322068fd330db","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-tracker-docs-bedrock-gateway-md-de156192ce90-22068fd330db.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_6cce2c47a52259eea7f9999fe0d31eb4"],"title":"2389-research/tracker/docs/bedrock-gateway.md @ de156192ce90","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:58:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e84b170547b94b28be27584dd3fef74b"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0033f403061d1fcd65a53659f6a29b0db8154a50c7f1e67c4b944c44290eb9d1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Secret inputs are staged to a 0600 file and ${inputs.<name>} resolves only to the path, so secret values never enter prompts, the provider wire, traces, or checkpoints."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0c4d60a1490d8accd9e220c00e9b0f2b38c5b4addaaa71031528cc263ade3e99"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Workflows can declare environmental requirements via a requires: header line; as of v0.29.0 only git is checked, and unrecognized entries warn and continue."},{"claim_ids":["clm_108f48d0af773248d06641ebeb5ba4e7569d86c768659edd76ee1edb39f410c3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Headless operation is supported via --webhook-url: human gates are POSTed as JSON and the pipeline resumes on callback, with flags for timeout, timeout action, and auth header."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1afe1f84d910bdc2750434ec146a76b632d9c4b508a0d8a8b6e4c2ccf6ac7a8a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tracker targets teams running multi-agent LLM build/review pipelines, offering human gates, budget ceilings, audit trails, and front-ends for terminal, TUI, and Slack."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1b44954215456db181435ebd6f1d5594c5e9dee32ebc8974d1c33de4c2829bb8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The engine supports eight node types: agent, human gate, tool, parallel, fan_in, subgraph, manager_loop, and conditional."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2ace9cc7463af402aed1ac779f0b4264c4d94066f742ef78cf6ca7acc379b71a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Git artifact commits per terminal node outcome are enabled only via the library's WithGitArtifacts(true) option; the README states there is no CLI flag for this today."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4452831a294aa151c7597473296fd2bfaec3d5fc41f4180a9e04161fdecbf0d3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Each agent node runs a fresh LLM session; data flows between nodes via context keys (ctx.*, params.*, graph.*), not conversation history, with per-node scoping available."},{"claim_ids":["clm_501f196bd2976c0d357d8f4f5bc916c6a43edf2554e6c7391f1847534e5482da"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tracker supports four LLM providers: anthropic, openai, gemini, and openai-compat, configured via tracker setup or environment variables stored in ~/.config/2389/tracker/.env."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5f8e67187f605287fceff8497556b07ba7cc355861fe2a5f7457e60b68fec3a0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent, tool, and interview nodes can declare writes:/reads: context keys; missing declared writes hard-fail the node, and reads: pins fidelity of upstream keys."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8069d8372df06538b2c1c7b3fde1e1f59c88207188e1dbe7bd42cfdb8de2f070"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"All providers can be routed through Cloudflare AI Gateway via TRACKER_GATEWAY_URL or --gateway-url, with per-provider base-URL overrides taking precedence over the gateway."},{"claim_ids":["clm_875620f8d8be213726cb6b23a92683f08dd62fbfe6931f5ebea93653520bb1d4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Variable expansion is single-pass so resolved values are never re-scanned, preventing recursive expansion; unknown --param keys hard-fail at startup."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9ef92e1cb7f5544b14d523f0ec508e729692d4eb228be6885c7a2220c74047b6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The superspec workflow includes per-phase mechanical quality gates (build, test, lint, coverage, complexity) and a final TraceabilityAudit gate verifying spec requirements map to implementation and test coverage."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bafb075e18422d7b049382327a8b22195e3ad3626b9181d9175553aab650c188"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Tracker is a three-layer stack: an LLM client with provider adapters, an agent session with turn loop and context compaction, and a pipeline engine with graph execution, checkpoints, and TUI."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c487bff315a8566467bfc106adaadce4e00114698e3688cec0f7c2ce292bd714"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The working_dir attribute for per-node working directories is validated against path traversal and shell metacharacters."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c76187eedf2a776c182839941f859ef5e0a4e2ecbb0e276d65e141e1f0c8dd79"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Human gates support five modes: choice, freeform, hybrid, yes/no, and interview, with interview answers stored as JSON plus a markdown summary."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e8dd87589465e420d15b1242aea80672aa91435e6564d5169cce667669d5965c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The core engine is UI-agnostic: TUI, Slack bot, and terminal REPL are peers on one library boundary sharing a transport-neutral transport/chatops core."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ec3407f15420378be2f4267fbe90627330ac76ace1963f7a9270b87e0fe055db"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Both build workflows run a SpecLint preflight (dangling refs, contradictory constants, contract mismatches) that fails closed before decomposition."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f34931e1a6a9ce2d1a87a7a94feb49fc536c11d46cab9276ef2c87e5699da537"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Pipelines are defined in .dip files using the Dippin DSL, with workflow headers declaring goal, start, exit, defaults (model/provider), and edges between nodes."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0033f403061d1fcd65a53659f6a29b0db8154a50c7f1e67c4b944c44290eb9d1","clm_0c4d60a1490d8accd9e220c00e9b0f2b38c5b4addaaa71031528cc263ade3e99","clm_108f48d0af773248d06641ebeb5ba4e7569d86c768659edd76ee1edb39f410c3","clm_1afe1f84d910bdc2750434ec146a76b632d9c4b508a0d8a8b6e4c2ccf6ac7a8a","clm_1b44954215456db181435ebd6f1d5594c5e9dee32ebc8974d1c33de4c2829bb8","clm_2ace9cc7463af402aed1ac779f0b4264c4d94066f742ef78cf6ca7acc379b71a","clm_4452831a294aa151c7597473296fd2bfaec3d5fc41f4180a9e04161fdecbf0d3","clm_501f196bd2976c0d357d8f4f5bc916c6a43edf2554e6c7391f1847534e5482da","clm_5f8e67187f605287fceff8497556b07ba7cc355861fe2a5f7457e60b68fec3a0","clm_8069d8372df06538b2c1c7b3fde1e1f59c88207188e1dbe7bd42cfdb8de2f070","clm_875620f8d8be213726cb6b23a92683f08dd62fbfe6931f5ebea93653520bb1d4","clm_9ef92e1cb7f5544b14d523f0ec508e729692d4eb228be6885c7a2220c74047b6","clm_